  << /ActualText (Definition of the detailed requirements\015\nIn this phase\054 the following issues were addressed\072 \n\n\050a\051 the\015 aim and intended use of the ontology\054 \n\050b\051 the information that\015 must be provided by the ontology\054 \n\050c\051 users of the ontology\054\015 \n\050d\051 the questions which the ontology needs to be able to\015\nanswer\054 i\056e\056 the competency questions\056)
