1512 0 obj
  << /ActualText (1\056 The model must represent a selected domain\054 which is\015\n\015\nmanufacturing and assembly resource capability model\055\015\ning\073\015\n\015\n2\056 The model must be both human\055 and computer\055\015\ninterpretable\054 it must be formalized and have a mean\055\015\ning that can be understood and used by different users\054\015\n\015\napplications\054 and systems\073\015\n\015\n3\056 Semantics need to be defined in such a way that the mean\055\015\ning of each structure in the knowledge representation is\015\n\015\nclear and there is no ambiguity in terminology\073\015\n\015\n4\056 The resource capability descriptions should be estab\055\015\nlished easily and rapidly\054 and the descriptions should be\015\n\015\neasily re\055used and extended\073\015\n\015\n5\056 The proposed knowledge representation must be suit\055\015\nable for reasoning\054 and it should support activities\015\n\015\nsuch as matching the resource capabilities against prod\055\015\nuct requirements\054 searching for and selecting suitable\015\n\015\nresources\054 and proposing feasible system configurations\056)
     /K [ 429 ]
     /P 1513 0 R
     /Pg 654 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1513 0 obj
  << /K [ 1512 0 R ]
     /P 2372 0 R
     /S /P
     /Pg 654 0 R
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

1514 0 obj
  << /ActualText (1\056 What capabilities does a specific resource have\077\015\n2\056 What simple capabilities are needed to form combined\015\ncapability X\077\015\n3\056 What capabilities does a combination of specific\015\nresources have\077\015\n4\056 What are the parameter values of combined capability\015\nX when the required simple capabilities are combined\077\015\n\015\n5\056 What resources are involved in the current system con\055\015\nfiguration\077\015\n\015\n6\056 What resources form functional combinations in the cur\055\015\nrent system configuration\077\015\n\015\n7\056 What capabilities exist in the current layout\077\015\n8\056 What capabilities satisfy a certain upper\055level process\015\n\015\nrequirement at the concept\055name level\054 e\056g\056 what capa\055\015\nbilities can be used to perform a \034material removing\035\015\n\015\nprocess\077\015\n9\056 What resources in the current layout have capabilities\015\n\015\nthat match with a product requirement on a capability\055\015\nconcept\055name level\077\015\n\015\n10\056 Which of these resources match with the product\015\n\015\nrequirements on the capability\055parameter level\077 \050Con\055\015\ntinuation from Q9\051\015\n\015\n11\056 Which resources in a certain search space have capabil\055\015\nities that contribute to combined capability X\077\015\n\015\n12\056 With which resources could resource A be combined in\015\norder to achieve combined capability X\077)
     /K [ 430 ]
     /P 1515 0 R
     /Pg 654 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

