  << /ActualText (Competency Questions\072 \n\n\nModel is valid only if they can be answered for any instance\056 \n\nIf a CQ is not solvable that means theres a gap in our mode\056\n\nWhat components have Device D\077 Which one are interactives and whose geometry is static\077\n Which is the Component C 3D representation \050size\054 position\054 pivot\051\nWhich states can transit C and what is its initial state\077\nGiven a state\054 which transitions are possible and under which guards\077\nWhich action and movement realize a given transition\077\nWhat signals a transition emits and which machines are affected\077\nWhat procedures can be executed over D\077\nWhich one is the ordered step sequence of P and which transition is realize in each step\077\nWhat must be done before P \050preconditions\051 and what is guaranteed when finish \050post conditions\051\077\nWhat components intervene in P\077\nWhich rules govern P\077\nP depends or unlock other procedure\077\nWhich vocabulary \050actions\054 movements\054 dimensions\051 use D\077\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n)
