2088 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The conceptual model is required to answer the following competency questions\015\nfor any device instantiated from its manual\072\015\n\015\nCQ1\056  Which components does a given device comprise\054 and which are interactive\015as opposed to static geometry\077\015\050Component\051\n\nCQ2\056  What is the 3D representation \024 size\054 placement and pivot \024 of a given\015component\077\015 \015\050Representation\051\n\nCQ3\056  Which states can a given component occupy\054 and which is its initial state\077\015\015\050State\051\n\nCQ4\056  From a given state\054 which transitions are possible\054 and under which guard\077\015Transition\054 Signal\n\nCQ5\056  Which action and movement realise a given transition\077\015 Transition\054 Signal\054 \n\nCQ6\056  Which transitions depend on the state of another component\054 and which signals does a transition emit\077\015\n\nCQ7\056  Which procedures can be performed on a given device\077\015\050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ8\056  What is the ordered sequence of steps of a given procedure\054 and which transition does each step perform\077\015\050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ9\056  Which conditions must hold before a given procedure \050preconditions\051\054 and\015      which does it guarantee on completion \050postconditions\051\077\015\050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ10\056 Which components does a given procedure involve\077\015\050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ11\056 Which rules govern a given procedure\077\015 \050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ12\056 Does a given procedure depend on\054 or unlock\054 another procedure\077\015\050Step\054 Pre\057Postcondition\054 Rule\054\051\n\nCQ13\056 Which vocabulary terms \024 actions\054 movements and dimensions \024 does a given\015device use\077 Vocabulary)
     /K [ 717 ]
     /P 2089 0 R
     /Pg 654 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

