2096 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Competency Question\n\nThe model provides\054 for any workplace device described in a user manual\072\015\n\015\n\055 The device\047s full set of components\054 each with its 3D representation \050its\015\n  dimensions\054 placement and pivot\051 and its role \024 interactive\054 static geometry\054\015\n  or a user\055added extension\056\015\n\055 The behaviour of each component as a state machine\072 the states it can occupy\054\015\n  its initial state\054 and the guarded transitions between them\056\015\n\055 The cross\055component effects of behaviour\072 the signals a transition emits and\015\n  the transitions they trigger in other machines\056\015\n\055 The controlled vocabulary from which every transition\054 state and signal draws\015\n  its terms \024 dimensions\054 actions\054 movements\054 state values\054 signals and guard\015\n  operators\056\015\n\055 The procedures that can be performed on the device\054 each as an ordered\015\n  sequence of steps\054 together with the transition each step performs\054 the\015\n  preconditions it requires\054 the postconditions it guarantees\054 the rules that\015\n  govern it\054 and its dependencies on other procedures\056\015\n\055 The components a procedure involves\054 as a derived relation over its steps\054\015\n  preconditions and postconditions\056\015\n\055 The provenance of every element \024 whether it was stated in the manual\054\015\n  inferred\054 reused\054 decided by the user\054 or defaulted\056)
     /K [ 721 ]
     /P 2097 0 R
     /Pg 654 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
