2100 0 obj
  << /ActualText (The model provides\054 for any workplace device described in a user manual\072\015\n\015\nThe device\047s full set of components\054 each with its 3D representation \050its dimensions\054 placement and pivot\051 and its role \024 interactive\054 static geometry\054\015or a user\055added extension\056\015\nThe behaviour of each component as a state machine\072 the states it can occupy\054\015its initial state\054 and the guarded transitions between them\056\015\n\nThe cross\055component effects of behaviour\072 the signals a transition emits and\015the transitions they trigger in other machines\056\015\n\nThe controlled vocabulary from which every transition\054 state and signal draws\015its terms \024 dimensions\054 actions\054 movements\054 state values\054 signals and guard operators\056\015\n\nThe procedures that can be performed on the device\054 each as an ordered\015sequence of steps\054 together with the transition each step performs\054 the\015preconditions it requires\054 the postconditions it guarantees\054 the rules that\015govern it\054 and its dependencies on other procedures\056\015\n\nThe components a procedure involves\054 as a derived relation over its steps\054\015preconditions and postconditions\056\015\n\nThe provenance of every element \024 whether it was stated in the manual\054\015inferred\054 reused\054 decided by the user\054 or defaulted\056)
